    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d936">

                <pb facs="0952" n="940" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg940"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">561.35E1/341: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-04-28T20:00:00+01:00">April 28, 1937—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 28—3 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>23. A plenary session today adopted quotas outlined in my No. 21, April 26, 5
                    p.m., and accepted accompanying report of Negotiating Committee<anchor n="21"
                        xml:id="d936-f1"/> subject, however, to right to pass upon final statement
                    in draft agreement of matters it covers.</p>
                <p>Conference is not releasing quota figures or specific information regarding any
                    of them.</p>
                <p>We have changed text submitted to you in my No. 22, April 27, 8 p.m.,<anchor
                        n="22" xml:id="d936-f2"/> and will transmit revised text after further
                    discussion with Drafting Committee.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
